cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "DyingCyrus-DB: Bangladesh Bank Financial Database"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - alias: o-rnob
    name: "Ow1nomics"
abstract: >-
  An open SQLite database of annual balance sheet, income statement,
  profitability, asset-quality and capital-adequacy data for 17 Bangladeshi
  banks: 11 DSE-listed commercial banks (2015-2025) and 6 state-owned
  or specialised banks with coverage back to 1972, kept as two separate segments over a raw layer of untouched source cells. Every data-quality issue
  found during the build is logged and queryable rather than silently
  corrected.
keywords:
  - banking
  - bangladesh
  - financial data
  - open data
  - sqlite
  - non-performing loans
  - capital adequacy
repository-code: "https://github.com/o-rnob/DyingCyrus-DB"
license: CC0-1.0
version: "3.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-20"
